Actually simpler and safe: better-sqlite3 doesn't allow async in transaction, but we can implement the transaction manually with BEGIN/COMMIT/ROLLBACK exec statements:

```ts
const db = getDatabase();
db.exec("BEGIN");
try {
  await InsertUserAccount({...});
  await InsertSession({...});
  db.exec("COMMIT");
} catch (e) { db.exec("ROLLBACK"); ... }
```

